{"id":"quiza_","lemma":"quizá","pos":"adv","rank":220,"glosses":["perhaps, maybe"],"ipa":"/kiˈθa/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/15/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-quiz%C3%A1.wav","examples":[{"text":"Quizá solo esté loco.","en":"Maybe I'm just crazy.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/800992","words":[null,{"g":"sole"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"crazy"}]},{"text":"Quizá no sea joven.","en":"Maybe he's not young.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/137832","words":[null,{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"young, youthful"}]},{"text":"Quizá tengamos que hacerlo.","en":"Maybe we have to do it.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/352393","words":[null,{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"to do","l":"hacer"}]},{"text":"Quizá lo hiciste mal.","en":"Maybe you did it wrong.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/459539","words":[null,{"g":"it / him"},{"g":"to do","l":"hacer"},{"g":"badly, poorly, ill"}]},{"text":"Quizá ella sepa la respuesta.","en":"Maybe she knows the answer.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/639386","words":[null,{"g":"she"},{"g":"to know, to understand","l":"saber"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"reply"}]}]}